---
description: Repository map and safe change workflow for Arkhe OS.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `docs/architecture/AI_AGENT_OPERATING_MODEL.md` and `AGENTS.md` before
editing. Arkhe OS is a polyglot multi-project repository: use the nearest
manifest and README, not a guessed root command. Keep changes inside the target
component, preserve existing worktree changes, and do not edit generated files
or binary artifacts. Treat crypto, identity, governance, boot/kernel, hardware,
and deployment code as security-sensitive. Run and report the narrowest
component-level validation available.
